  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>26</span><font>2024.01</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>2023年相关数字经济（国家）政策汇总</h2> <b>2024.01.26</b> <p><a class=\"weui-flex original_primary_card appmsg_card_context wx_tap_card js_wx_tap_highlight\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwOTk2OTQ1NA==&mid=2247575765&idx=2&sn=0267cbe6159d328f4fcc395449dcdb86&chksm=97682094a01fa982b466a1b85a7999653c125850f1d88c97472e56b629fbeb6effcecb2f9771&mpshare=1&scene=1&srcid=0125LfGYdrxkAYj4EynmNo8C&sharer_shareinfo=7d3bde50f4a0a08574ae8ae3bae23690&sharer_shareinfo_first=7d3bde50f4a0a08574ae8ae3bae23690&key=08742fdeb290231e7d752c1c600fd4f49ce0957415fc945aca2233c46f273ced64c24cf6b30c198a2d510922dfbe00c4584e8b32c9aece95f2f6463ded48bd92e3c8125fc78f3856c5d42cb5c4a2d7bb9c27778d4a433b9d4790b3d1c25fc8fc8c1840c44b64a28db4d7886d64bff708a382e3ab1d2d14cd3f6b7bf70cbb5954&ascene=0&uin=MjMyNDYwNTIyMg%3D%3D&devicetype=Windows+11+x64&version=63090819&lang=zh_CN&countrycode=CN&exportkey=n_ChQIAhIQXvo%2B1HTtmYKUkgR%2FKgCABBLgAQIE97dBBAEAAAAAACQ%2FNdE6DUUAAAAOpnltbLcz9gKNyK89dVj0%2BDJvT3D3qYXYXVst64ctQW3s%2BwruJBxixGYcbehOIW6b%2FNZ0SYP%2FxOIu144YkAZtl%2BGrBCOZTs%2Br8BwdmTNdSO6SK6%2BE8DWpkdRUZJTFCcWlYupqNg6BmFNJanyFQfphJLJxrOfEX%2Bx24KvQ7DdzYhZ4YrUw3lmBt3VT5hAYvyMMERThxoNWso747gu65TVY%2Fjm3pNE%2Bx5UF16CB0XdmiWr3fkamEb2xFiGSQvXUokLjv4aZ40fQyUsH&acctmode=0&pass_ticket=GflIxLlz4wkX1KdHyI569i5NIIn4U5qcTKdp6zp2ci%2F8Il3gXbFxXXqC4Khy1WAwQ5SCMxbAej%2BjBjFxm9p%2Fow%3D%3D&wx_header=1&fasttmpl_type=0&fasttmpl_fullversion=7046507-zh_CN-zip&fasttmpl_flag=3#\" style=\"margin: 16px 0px 0px;padding: 20px 16px;outline: 0px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-user-drag: none;cursor: pointer;display: flex;position: relative;background-color: var(--APPMSGCARD-BG);border-radius: 8px;user-select: none;line-height: 1.4;align-items: center\"><span style=\"margin: 0px 12px 0px 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;border-radius: 50%;overflow: hidden;vertical-align: middle;width: 40px;height: 40px\"><br/></span></a><section></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">1、2023 年1月，工业和信息化部、国家网信办、发展改革委等十六部门印发《关于促进数据安全产业发展的指导意见》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2023-01/15/content_5737026.htm\">https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2023-01/15/content_5737026.htm</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">2、2023年 2月，中共中央、国务院印发了《数字中国建设整体布局规划》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">http://www.cac.gov.cn/2023-02/27/c_1679136694986243.htm?eqid=dd2a06fd000386020000000364477fef</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">3、2023年3月，国家能源局印发《关于加快推进能源数字化智能化发展的若干意见》</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2023-04/02/content_5749758.htm\">https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2023-04/02/content_5749758.htm</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">4、2023年6月，财政部、工信部联合印发《关于开展中小企业数字化转型城市试点工作的通知》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202306/content_6886368.htm\">https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202306/content_6886368.htm</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">5、2023年6月，中国民用航空局发布《关于落实数字中国建设总体部署 加快推动智慧民航建设发展的指导意见》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202307/content_6889672.htm\">https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202307/content_6889672.htm</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">6、2023年7月24日，中国人民银行关于《中国人民银行业务领域数据安全管理办法(征求意见稿)》公开征求意见的通知。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"http://www.moj.gov.cn/pub/sfbgw/lfyjzj/lflfyjzj/202307/t20230724_483267.html\">http://www.moj.gov.cn/pub/sfbgw/lfyjzj/lflfyjzj/202307/t20230724_483267.html</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">7、2023年8月，财政部发布了《企业数据资源相关会计处理暂行规定》，该规定自 2024 年1月1日起施行。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10746/202310/content_6907744.html\">https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10746/202310/content_6907744.html</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">8、2023年9月，交通运输部印发《关于推进公路数字化转型 加快智慧公路建设发展的意见》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://xxgk.mot.gov.cn/2020/jigou/glj/202309/t20230920_3922478.html\">https://xxgk.mot.gov.cn/2020/jigou/glj/202309/t20230920_3922478.html</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">9、2023 年 10 月，国务院印发《关于推进普惠金融高质量发展的实施意见》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202310/content_6908495.htm\">https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202310/content_6908495.htm</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">10、2023年11月，中国人民银行、国家外汇管理局发布《中国人民银行国家外汇管理局关于提升银行办理资本项目业务数字化服务水平的通知》。</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202311/content_6916279.htm\">https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202311/content_6916279.htm</a></span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">11、2023年12月15日，国家数据局发布的《“数据要素×”三年行动计划（2024—2026年）（征求意见稿）》</span></section></p><p><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/hdjl/yjzq/202312/t20231215_1362671.html\">https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/hdjl/yjzq/202312/t20231215_1362671.html</a> </span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">12、2023年12月29日&nbsp;，国家发展改革委、国家数据局、中央网信办、工业和信息化部、国家能源局联合印发《深入实施“东数西算”工程加快构建全国一体化算力网的实施意见》</span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><a href=\"https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/xxgk/zcfb/tz/202312/t20231229_1363000.html\">https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/xxgk/zcfb/tz/202312/t20231229_1363000.html</a> </span></span></section><section><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px\"><br/></span></section></p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
